Article 6 (Secretary)
(1) The Committee shall have one secretary to support and facilitate its efficient operation, who shall be the Director in charge of Planning and Finance of the Korea Coast Guard.
(2) The secretary shall perform the following duties under the direction of the chairperson:
1. Preparing agenda items;
2. Making preparations necessary for meetings;
3. Preparing and keeping minutes of meetings;
4. Other affairs of the Committee.
